Defines the block as a redstone power source. Configurable Fields value: The redstone power value the block emits (can be mapped). Defaults to 15 Tip The field of this behaviour can be mapped to a block-state. Example { "behaviour": { "powersource": { "value": { "age=0": 0, "age=1": 15 } } }
} Example with constant value { "behaviour": { "powersource": { "value": 5 } }
}

