Makes the block drop xp when being mined without the silk-touch enchantment. Configurable Fields min: Minimum amount of XP to drop max: Maximum amount of XP to drop Tip The values of the min and max fields can be mapped to block-states. Example { "behaviour": { "drop_xp": { "min": { "age=0": 0, "age=1": 0, "age=2": 4 }, "max": { "age=0": 0, "age=1": 0, "age=2": 6 } } }
