Allows you to create lamps that either switch on/off or cycle through a list of light levels on player interaction. Configurable Fields on: Light level to use for the 'on' state off: Light level to use for the 'off' state cycle: List of light levels to cycle through. Simple on / off lamp { "lamp": { "on": 15, "off": 0 }
