The filament:skin component works similar to the minecraft:repairable component. You can either specify a list of items or an item-tag, for which item you want the skin to be applicable for. { "components": { "filament:skin": ["minecraft:wooden_pickaxe", "iron_pickaxe"] }
} You can also use item-tags: { "components": { "filament:skin": "#minecraft:pickaxes" }
} For everything else, use behaviours as described below.

